@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Hiragino Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
scale 1 as 70 pixels
hide time-axis

concise "レシート" as R
concise "バッチ" as B
concise "インスタンス" as I

@0
R is "r1"
B is "オープン（バッチ N）"
I is "待機"

@1
R is "r2"

@2
R is "ラッチ"
B is "N クローズ"
I is "N を評価"

@3
R is "r3"

@4
I is "N を確定 + ディスパッチ"

@5
R is "r4"

@6
R is "ラッチ"
B is "N+1 クローズ：r3, r4"
I is "N+1 を評価"

@7
R is "-"
I is "待機"

B@2 <-> @6 : r3 と r4 はラッチ後に到着 -> N+1 を待つ
@enduml
